<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
    <tr valign="top" height="400" >
        <td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
            <![CDATA[
                    <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span
                            style="line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">Hi&nbsp;{!Contact.NSP_Preferred_First_Name__c},</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="color:red"><br></span></p>

                    <p class="MsoNormal" style=""></p>
                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="">Your annual benefits open enrollment is upon us!&nbsp;Based
                        on our records your benefits plan year begins on <span
                            style="line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; color: red;">{Benefits Renewal
                            Date}</span><span style="line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;">.</span>
                        <o:p></o:p>
                    </p>
                    <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span
                            style="line-height: 115%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif;"><br></span></p>

                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="">I will be working directly with you to configure your new
                        plan year changes and set up open enrollment.&nbsp;Once you have reviewed the
                        renewal documents sent to you from Insperity Insurance Services and signed off
                        on them, <b>please let me know</b> so that I can make the necessary updates in
                        iSolved to the benefit plans.<o:p></o:p>
                    </p>
                    <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p>

                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="">Do you plan to use isolved for open enrollment? If so,
                        typically we would like to start this as soon as possible so new cards can be
                        mailed out before the new plan year begins. If not, I'm happy to show you how
                        to enter your employees’ enrolments manually so that their payroll deductions
                        are correct for the new plan year.<o:p></o:p>
                    </p>
                    <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p>

                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="">Next Steps:<o:p></o:p>
                    </p>
                    <p class="MsoNormal" style=""><br></p>

                    <ul style="margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
                        <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
                        tab-stops:list .5in">Sign off on new rates/plans from IIS and&nbsp;<b>let
                                me know you have done so</b>
                            <o:p></o:p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
                        tab-stops:list .5in">I will configure iSolved<o:p></o:p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
                        tab-stops:list .5in">I will send an export to you from iSolved with the
                            updated information to sign off on<o:p></o:p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
                        tab-stops:list .5in">We will set up a call to review the employee
                            enrollment portal and any questions you have about the iSolved enrollment
                            process<o:p></o:p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
                        tab-stops:list .5in">Open Enrollment starts in iSolved for the dates you
                            choose<o:p></o:p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
                        tab-stops:list .5in">You will approve all benefits once the Open
                            Enrollment Closes, and let me know once you have done so<o:p></o:p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
                        tab-stops:list .5in">I will make sure carriers are updated via Insperity
                            Insurance Services</li>
                    </ul>
                    <div style=""><span style="line-height: 115%; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;">If you have any questions, do not
                            hesitate to
                            reach out to me via email or phone, I'm always happy to help!</span></div>
                    <div style=""><span style="line-height: 115%; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;"><br></span></div>
                    <p style="font-size: 12pt;"></p>
            ]]>
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>